          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For a genuinely invisible result, <strong class="text-white">Ghostshield Siloxa-Tek 8500</strong> is the best natural look paver sealer we have used, with <strong class="text-white">Foundation Armor SX5000 WB</strong> the better value across a large driveway and <strong class="text-white">Eagle Natural Seal</strong> the budget option. All three protect without gloss, without darkening and without touching the traction underfoot.
          </p>
